# Google Index Checker Environment Configuration
# Options (You can provide either Serper API Key OR Google Custom Search API Key + CX)
# If left empty, you can also provide API keys directly inside the web UI Settings.

# 1. Serper.dev API Key (Recommended for 100% CAPTCHA-free results, 2,500 free queries):
# Get free key from: https://serper.dev
SERPER_API_KEY=

# 2. Google Custom Search JSON API (Alternative official method, 100 free queries/day):
# Get key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Get CX from: https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/
GOOGLE_SEARCH_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_SEARCH_CX=
